part statements
  tally 2
  note "The record files of tmp/cases/A/records/ that the questions read, as observations (L §5.19). The importer's dialect for these files is not part of tally 2 (O:A-1): a scratch script stood in for it, copying each row as it stands (scratch/w-a/conv.py), each row citing its file and line, its kind the row's type and counterparty (the importer's classification, data). The Wektor registers, the Lazur export and Ania's savings export are read only by their balances (records.tally)."

